# tally 2.1.8 R12 with R13.1 (item 5 of the follow-up): a result is all the form prints, so an explanation whose lines
# differ between the seen and the unseen account of an undecided same line is HOLE-IMPRECISE, the hole under its
# head and the cut (x); a ledger on which the two agree in every line prints it (l). 2.1.8's first refcore compared
# a block's first line only and printed the seen account's derivation under the hole.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-04-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
input amt: money PLN
input d_save: int

move save[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, d_save)
  leg cash from konto to sav amount amt


version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 900.00 PLN "s"
  d_save = 15 "s"
  opening[konto] = 1050.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

version st_konto
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto
  bank[a2] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "a"

version st_sav
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-03
  covers sav
  bank[b1] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "b"

version joined
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known window(2026-04-05, 2026-04-09)
  same bank[a2] = bank[b1]

ask x: explain bal(konto, 2026-03-31) as known 2026-04-07
ask l: residuals konto 2026-03 as known 2026-04-07
=== expect
l: residuals konto 2026-03
  2026-03 move save: model -900.00 PLN, observed -950.00 PLN, difference -50.00 PLN
    matched save[2026-03] on 2026-03-15: model -900.00 PLN, observed -950.00 PLN, difference -50.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-04-07
x: ?"date within window(2026-04-05, 2026-04-09) not precise enough for the cut 2026-04-07" (bank[a2], bank[b1], joined)
  cut 2026-04-07
warning: WARN-NEGATIVE konto is below zero from 2026-04-15
warning: WARN-UNREAD place unexplained is read by nothing
